lico sobre o edital.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; background: whitesmoke;\">Caminhada Rumos S&atilde;o Paulo </span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; background: white;\">[com interpreta&ccedil;&atilde;o em Libras]</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; background: whitesmoke;\">ter&ccedil;a <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">1 de agosto de 2023</strong> | <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">20h<br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; background: white;\">[dura&ccedil;&atilde;o aproximada: 120 minutos]<br>Sala Ita&uacute; Cultural &ndash; 224 lugares</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; background: white;\">[classifica&ccedil;&atilde;o indicativa: livre, segundo autodefini&ccedil;&atilde;o]</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; background: white;\">&nbsp;e</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">ntrada gratuita</span></p>","publicationDate":"Publicado em 24/07/2023","publishedAt":"2023-07-24T16:57:33.000-03:00","updatedDate":"Atualizado às 03:00 de 11/05/2025","image":"https://s3.sa-east-1.amazonaws.com/prd.editor.fundacaoitau.org.br/public/image/1104/file/optimized-d7e3881f107e0d4f2e8dd5eb66ad2b4d.png","cover":true,"rights":"Itaú Cultural","cover_position":50,"programs_position":50,"miniature_position":99,"image_description":"Banner